# Cursor Rules for Laundry SaaS Platform

## 📚 Prerequisites

**BEFORE implementing any feature, ALWAYS read:**
1. `blueprint.md` - Arsitektur sistem, teknologi stack, prinsip SOLID
2. `development-plan.md` - Roadmap pengembangan dan fase implementasi

---

## 🏗️ Tech Stack & Architecture

**Core Technologies:**
- Next.js 14+ (App Router) - Vercel serverless
- AdminLTE 3/4 (Bootstrap 5) untuk dashboard
- PostgreSQL (Neon.tech) - Region Singapore
- Prisma/Drizzle untuk ORM
- NextAuth.js - Role: SUPERADMIN, OWNER, STAFF
- Cloudinary - Storage gambar

**Code Structure (SOLID):**
```
src/
├── components/     # UI components (AdminLTE)
├── controllers/    # API route handlers
├── services/       # Business logic
├── repositories/   # Data access layer
├── types/          # TypeScript types & enums
└── lib/            # Utilities
```

**Layer Separation:**
- Controllers → Services → Repositories → Database
- Components hanya untuk UI rendering

---

## 🔐 Security & Multi-Tenancy (CRITICAL)

### Proxy for Tenant Isolation (MANDATORY)
**Gunakan `proxy.ts` untuk route protection dan tenant isolation:**
- Proxy intercepts requests di edge runtime
- Verifikasi authentication pada protected routes
- Memastikan `outletId` ada di session
- Menambahkan `x-outlet-id` dan `x-user-role` ke request headers
- Enforce role-based access control

**File: `proxy.ts`** - Logic untuk tenant isolation
**File: `middleware.ts`** - Export proxy sebagai default (Next.js requirement)

### Tenant Isolation in Queries (MANDATORY)
**Setiap query database HARUS filter `outletId`:**

```typescript
// ✅ CORRECT
await prisma.order.findMany({
  where: { id: orderId, outletId: session.outletId }
});

// ❌ WRONG
await prisma.order.findMany({ where: { id: orderId } });
```

**Rules:**
- Setiap API request verifikasi `session.outletId`
- Setiap query include `outletId` di WHERE clause
- Jangan percaya `outlet_id` dari client
- Gunakan `buildTenantWhere()` dari `tenant-helpers.ts` untuk konsistensi

### DTO Pattern (MANDATORY)
**Jangan return raw database objects - gunakan DTO untuk scrub:**
- `outletId` (internal only)
- `isPro` (prevent manipulation)
- Password hashes
- Internal IDs

### Public Tracking
- Gunakan `trackingCode` (random string), bukan internal ID
- Minimal data exposure, rate limiting wajib
- Jangan expose outlet information

### Input Validation
- **Selalu pakai Zod** untuk validasi API
- Validate semua input sebelum database operations

---

## 🎨 UI/UX Standards

**AdminLTE Components:**
- Sidebar: Role-based menu
- Info Box: Statistik (Order hari ini, Omzet, Cucian tertunda)
- Datatables: List dengan search & filter
- Modals: Input forms
- Badges: `bg-warning` (Washing), `bg-success` (Ready), `bg-danger` (Failed), `bg-info` (Pending)
- Icons: FontAwesome (default AdminLTE)
- Responsive: Mobile-friendly, Bootstrap grid

---

## 📊 Database & Enums

**Enums (`src/types/enums/`):**
- `Role`: SUPERADMIN, OWNER, STAFF
- `OrderStatus`: QUEUED → WASHING → DRYING → IRONING → READY → TAKEN
- `PaymentStatus`: UNPAID, PENDING, SETTLEMENT, FAILURE
- `TransType`: SUBSCRIPTION, LAUNDRY_ORDER

**Important Fields:**
- `outletId` - Mandatory untuk tenant-scoped entities
- `trackingCode` - Random string untuk public tracking
- `slug` - URL-friendly untuk outlet microsite

---

## 💻 Code Quality

**SOLID Principles:**
- Single Responsibility: Satu layer, satu tanggung jawab
- Open/Closed: Gunakan interfaces untuk extensibility
- Dependency Inversion: Services depend on repository interfaces

**TypeScript:**
- No `any` types
- Proper interfaces untuk semua data structures
- Gunakan enums, bukan magic strings

**Error Handling:**
- Try-catch untuk async operations
- Proper HTTP status codes (400, 401, 403, 404, 500)
- Jangan expose sensitive info ke client

---

## 📝 Documentation Rules

**❌ JANGAN buat dokumentasi kecuali diminta:**
- No README.md di subdirectories
- No auto-generated docs
- No "helpful" documentation files

**✅ Buat dokumentasi hanya jika:**
- User explicitly requests
- Part of explicit task

**Code-First Approach:**
1. Code implementation
2. Code comments (inline)
3. Type definitions
4. Documentation files (only if requested)

---

## 🚀 Development Workflow (MANDATORY)

### ⚠️ CRITICAL: Setiap Tahap Development HARUS Mengikuti Workflow Ini

**JANGAN skip langkah apapun. Workflow ini MANDATORY untuk setiap implementasi.**

---

### 📝 Step 1: Before Implementation

**SEBELUM mulai coding, SELALU:**
1. ✅ Baca `blueprint.md` & `development-plan.md`
2. ✅ Pahami requirement dan arsitektur
3. ✅ Plan tenant isolation strategy
4. ✅ Define DTOs yang diperlukan
5. ✅ Plan input validation (Zod schemas)

---

### 💻 Step 2: Implementation Order

**Urutan implementasi (JANGAN skip):**
1. Database Schema (Prisma) - jika perlu
2. Types/Enums - define TypeScript types
3. Repository - data access layer
4. Service - business logic
5. Controller - API route handlers
6. Component - UI components (jika perlu)
7. **Tests - BUAT TESTS (MANDATORY)**

---

### ✅ Step 3: After Implementation - MANDATORY CHECKLIST

**SETELAH selesai implementasi, SELALU lakukan SEMUA langkah ini:**

#### 3.1. Create Tests (MANDATORY)
**Buat test files untuk semua yang diimplementasi:**
- ✅ Unit tests untuk functions/helpers
- ✅ Integration tests untuk services/repositories
- ✅ Component tests untuk UI components
- ✅ Test tenant isolation (jika applicable)
- ✅ Test security measures (jika applicable)

**Test Categories yang harus dicover:**
- ✅ **Tenant Isolation** - Verify `outletId` filtering
- ✅ **Security** - Validation, DTO scrubbing, auth
- ✅ **Error Handling** - Proper status codes
- ✅ **Edge Cases** - Boundary conditions
- ✅ **Integration** - End-to-end workflows

#### 3.2. Run Tests (MANDATORY)
**JALANKAN TESTS dan pastikan SEMUA PASS:**

```bash
npm test
```

**Requirements:**
- ✅ **SEMUA tests harus PASS** sebelum lanjut
- ✅ Jika ada test yang FAIL, FIX dulu sebelum lanjut
- ✅ Jangan mark task complete jika tests masih fail

#### 3.3. Update Development Plan (MANDATORY)
**SETELAH tests pass, SELALU update `development-plan.md`:**

1. ✅ Buka file `development-plan.md`
2. ✅ Cari task yang baru selesai
3. ✅ Mark sebagai completed: `[ ]` → `[x]`
4. ✅ Update phase status jika semua task di phase selesai
5. ✅ Tambahkan implementation notes jika perlu (tanggal, keputusan, blockers)

**Contoh:**
```markdown
- [x] **Multi-Tenancy Implementation** ✅ Completed (2025-01-22)
  - [x] Implementasi tenant isolation di proxy
  - [x] Buat utility function untuk filter outlet_id
  - [x] Setup context provider untuk outlet context
  - [x] Buat helper untuk validasi tenant access
  - [x] Test isolasi data antar tenant
```

**⚠️ JANGAN skip step ini. Ini MANDATORY untuk tracking progress.**

---

### 🎯 Completion Criteria

**Task dianggap SELESAI hanya jika:**
- ✅ Code implementation complete
- ✅ Tests dibuat dan SEMUA PASS
- ✅ `development-plan.md` sudah di-update
- ✅ Tidak ada linter errors
- ✅ Tenant isolation verified (jika applicable)
- ✅ Security measures verified (jika applicable)

**Jika salah satu belum selesai, task BELUM SELESAI.**

---

## 🎯 Feature Guidelines

**Order Management:**
- Auto-generate `trackingCode` (random, not sequential)
- Workflow: QUEUED → WASHING → DRYING → IRONING → READY → TAKEN
- Always filter by `outletId`

**Payment:**
- Upload bukti transfer ke Cloudinary
- Use `Transaction` model dengan `TransType` enum
- Verify payment status sebelum order completion

**Public Tracking:**
- Route: `/track/[trackingCode]`
- Minimal data, rate limiting wajib

**Outlet Microsite:**
- Route: `/outlet/[slug]`
- Public-facing, no auth required

---

## ⚠️ Common Mistakes (JANGAN LAKUKAN INI!)

1. ❌ Missing `outletId` filter
2. ❌ Returning raw database objects
3. ❌ Using internal IDs untuk public URLs
4. ❌ Exposing sensitive fields
5. ❌ Skipping input validation (Zod)
6. ❌ Mixing business logic di controllers
7. ❌ Direct database access dari controllers
8. ❌ Creating documentation tanpa request
9. ❌ **Skipping tests** - MANDATORY!
10. ❌ **Not running tests** - MANDATORY!
11. ❌ **Not updating `development-plan.md`** - MANDATORY!
12. ❌ Marking task complete sebelum tests pass
13. ❌ Marking task complete sebelum update development-plan.md

---

## 📋 MANDATORY Checklist - Copy Ini Setiap Kali

### ✅ Before Implementation
- [ ] Read `blueprint.md` & `development-plan.md`
- [ ] Understand requirements & architecture
- [ ] Plan tenant isolation strategy
- [ ] Define DTOs
