- [ ] **Run tests:** `npm test` - SEMUA harus PASS
- [ ] **Fix failing tests** jika ada (jangan skip!)
- [ ] **Update `development-plan.md`:** Mark tasks as `[x]` completed
- [ ] **Update phase status** jika phase selesai
- [ ] **Add implementation notes** jika perlu
- [ ] Verify no linter errors
- [ ] Verify tenant isolation (jika applicable)
- [ ] Verify security measures (jika applicable)

**⚠️ JANGAN mark task complete sampai SEMUA checklist di atas selesai!**

